  "topic": "The toddler and preschool child",
  "slug": "toddler-preschool",
  "blurb": "One year to five. The age that will not keep a dressing on, cannot reliably tell you where it hurts, and puts things in places it would not occur to you to look — and the age at which a great deal of what we were taught turns out to have been someone's reasonable worry, hardened into a rule."
